{
  "$description": "The only hand-edited source for cello.dev's design tokens. Run `pnpm tokens` after editing; it writes src/styles/tokens.css. Values with {dusk, day} are the two themes (A1): Dusk is the :root default, Day applies under [data-theme=\"light\"]. Every role carries its use-when line. See docs/design-system/proposal.md and identity.md.",
